//   * duplicated content at two different positions (r0 == r4 == b"alpha")
//   * an empty record (r2)
//   * a trailing CR kept as content (r5)
//   * non-UTF-8 / NUL bytes (r6)
// The eighth and ninth records are explicitly defined and distinct.
